      "question": "Select the number that will come in the place of the question mark (?), if &lsquo;+&rsquo; and &lsquo; &ndash; &lsquo; are interchanged and &lsquo;&times;&rsquo; and &lsquo;&divide;&rsquo; are interchanged 121 &times; 11 &ndash; 28 &divide; 3 + 17 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "Select the number that will come in the place of the question mark (?), if &lsquo;+&rsquo; and &lsquo; &ndash; &lsquo; are interchanged and &lsquo;&times;&rsquo; and &lsquo;&divide;&rsquo; are<br />\ninterchanged<br />\n121 &times; 11 &ndash; 28 &divide; 3 + 17 = ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "85",
          "html": "85"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "91",
          "html": "91"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "78",
          "html": "78"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "64",
          "html": "64"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Given equation: 121 × 11 – 28 ÷ 3 + 17 = ?</p>\n\n<p>Now, if ‘+’ and ‘–‘ and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged, then:</p>\n\n<p>⇒ 121 ÷ 11 + 28  × 3 - 17 = ? ⇒ 11 + 84 – 17 = ? ⇒ 95 - 17 = 78</p>\n",
      "images": [],
