      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language,<br />\n&lsquo;A + B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the mother of B&rsquo;;<br />\n&lsquo;A &minus; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the brother of B&rsquo;;<br />\n&lsquo;A &times; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the wife of B&rsquo; and<br />\n&lsquo;A &divide; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the father of B&rsquo;.<br />\nBased on the above, how is A related to D if &lsquo;A &times; B &divide; C + D&rsquo;?",
