      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6757254638e4d585fa5330c9.png\" />​</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, A is D's mother's mother or maternal grandmother.</p>\n",
