      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The logic followed here is: (First number × 3) × First number = Second number</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option 3) 15 – 450</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(15 × 3)</span></u> × 15 = 450</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">45 × 15</span></u> = 450</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>675 <span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\">≠</span> 450 (LHS <span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\">≠ </span>RHS)</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, out of all the options '</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">15 – 450</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">' is the odd one out.</span></p>\n",
